-- Souvenir Gifting Solutions — full database migration (schema + data)
-- Source: Supabase project corporate-gifting-crm (ajysowosgjaipczrwpfv), PostgreSQL 17.6
-- Snapshot: 2026-10-05, after migration 20261005095825 (51 migrations applied)
--
-- Recreates the complete application database in a NEW, empty Supabase project
-- (Postgres 17): extensions, enums, sequences, tables, constraints, ALL table data
-- (53 tables, 4229 rows), login accounts, indexes, functions, views,
-- triggers, RLS, policies, grants, comments, storage buckets and storage policies.
--
-- Data is loaded before foreign keys, indexes and triggers are created, so no
-- triggers fire during the load and every reference is validated when the foreign
-- keys are added afterwards.
--
-- Login accounts (17) are included WITHOUT password hashes. After restoring, each
-- user signs in once via "Forgot password" to set a new password.
--
-- Storage files are restored separately with upload_storage.mjs (see README.md).
--
-- Run once against the new project:
--   psql "<new project connection string>" -v ON_ERROR_STOP=1 -1 -f 01_database.sql
-- (The file is ~5 MB; use psql rather than the Supabase SQL editor.)

set check_function_bodies = false;


